 </span><span begin="00:33.310" end="00:33.430">on </span><span begin="00:33.430" end="00:33.520">the </span><span begin="00:33.520" end="00:33.670">M</span><span begin="00:33.670" end="00:33.700">-</span><span begin="00:33.700" end="00:33.910">way</span><span begin="00:33.910" end="00:33.910">, </span><span begin="00:33.910" end="00:34.480">speedin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.480" end="00:36.460"><span begin="00:34.480" end="00:34.900">LV </span><span begin="00:34.900" end="00:35.170">hat</span><span begin="00:35.170" end="00:35.170">, </span><span begin="00:35.170" end="00:35.710">backpack</span><span begin="00:35.710" end="00:35.710">, </span><span begin="00:35.710" end="00:35.800">and </span><span begin="00:35.800" end="00:36.460">sneakers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.580" end="00:38.110"><span begin="00:36.580" end="00:36.820">Any </span><span begin="00:36.820" end="00:37.060">girl </span><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:37.150">that </span><span begin="00:37.150" end="00:37.300">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.300" end="00:37.480">with </span><span begin="00:37.480" end="00:37.630">is </span><span begin="00:37.630" end="00:37.720">a </span><span begin="00:37.720" end="00:38.110">ten</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.110" end="00:40.240"><span begin="00:38.110" end="00:38.710">Nine</span><span begin="00:38.710" end="00:38.740">, </span><span begin="00:38.740" end="00:39.190">eight</span><span begin="00:39.190" end="00:39.190">, </span><span begin="00:39.190" end="00:39.670">bredren</span><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:39.670">, </span><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:40.240">decent</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.360" end="00:42.040"><span begin="00:40.360" end="00:40.570">Now </span><span begin="00:40.570" end="00:40.780">I'm </span><span begin="00:40.780" end="00:40.990">in </span><span begin="00:40.990" end="00:41.200">the </span><span begin="00:41.200" end="00:41.410">party </span><span begin="00:41.410" end="00:41.620">with </span><span begin="00:41.620" end="00:41.830">the </span><span begin="00:41.830" end="00:42.040">sweetest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.040" end="00:43.960"><span begin="00:42.040" end="00:42.490">Chocolate </span><span begin="00:42.490" end="00:42.820">brown </span><span begin="00:42.820" end="00:43.000">and </span><span begin="00:43.000" end="00:43.390">Reese's </span><span begin="00:43.390" end="00:43.960">Pieces</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.080" end="00:45.640"><span begin="00:44.080" end="00:44.350">My </span><span begin="00:44.350" end="00:44.620">brother </span><span begin="00:44.620" end="00:44.770">got </span><span begin="00:44.770" end="00:44.830">a </span><span begin="00:44.830" end="00:45.070">new </span><span begin="00:45.070" end="00:45.640">wristwatch</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.640" end="00:47.290"><span begin="00:45.640" end="00:45.790">But </span><span begin="00:45.790" end="00:46.000">don't </span><span begin="00:46.000" end="00:46.270">watch </span><span begin="00:46.270" end="00:46.480">that </span><span begin="00:46.480" end="00:46.630">'cause </span><span begin="00:46.630" end="00:46.720">you </span><span begin="00:46.720" end="00:46.930">could </span><span begin="00:46.930" end="00:47.290">get</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.470" end="00:49.570"><span begin="00:47.470" end="00:47.650">You </span><span begin="00:47.650" end="00:47.890">could </span><span begin="00:47.890" end="00:48.100">get </span><span begin="00:48.100" end="00:48.610">nauseous</span><span begin="00:48.610" end="00:48.610">, </span><span begin="00:48.610" end="00:48.820">could </span><span begin="00:48.820" end="00:49.060">get </span><span begin="00:49.060" end="00:49.570">seasick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.690" end="00:51.550"><span begin="00:49.690" end="00:49.810">I </span><span begin="00:49.810" end="00:50.020">mean</span><span begin="00:50.020" end="00:50.050">, </span><span begin="00:50.050" end="00:50.