300" end="00:58.420">to </span><span begin="00:58.420" end="00:58.540">your </span><span begin="00:58.540" end="00:58.870">guy</span><span begin="00:58.870" end="00:58.870">, </span><span begin="00:58.870" end="00:59.020">your </span><span begin="00:59.020" end="00:59.440">G'll </span><span begin="00:59.440" end="00:59.800">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.800" end="01:01.510"><span begin="00:59.800" end="00:59.890">I </span><span begin="00:59.890" end="00:59.980">ain't </span><span begin="00:59.980" end="01:00.250">talkin' </span><span begin="01:00.250" end="01:01.180">Mercedes</span><span begin="01:01.180" end="01:01.180">, </span><span begin="01:01.180" end="01:01.510">naw</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.660" end="01:02.890"><span begin="01:01.660" end="01:01.870">Let's </span><span begin="01:01.870" end="01:02.140">talk </span><span begin="01:02.140" end="01:02.320">'bout </span><span begin="01:02.320" end="01:02.890">drama</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.980" end="01:04.780"><span begin="01:02.980" end="01:03.070">I </span><span begin="01:03.070" end="01:03.220">got </span><span begin="01:03.220" end="01:03.280">a </span><span begin="01:03.280" end="01:03.520">peng </span><span begin="01:03.520" end="01:03.940">brownin' </span><span begin="01:03.940" end="01:04.030">in </span><span begin="01:04.030" end="01:04.180">my </span><span begin="01:04.180" end="01:04.780">zone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.960" end="01:06.670"><span begin="01:04.960" end="01:05.110">And </span><span begin="01:05.110" end="01:05.230">I'm </span><span begin="01:05.230" end="01:05.320">in </span><span begin="01:05.320" end="01:05.380">the </span><span begin="01:05.380" end="01:05.620">zone </span><span begin="01:05.620" end="01:05.890">too </span><span begin="01:05.890" end="01:06.100">like </span><span begin="01:06.100" end="01:06.670">Karma</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.790" end="01:08.470"><span begin="01:06.790" end="01:07.030">Man</